[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1783814453","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2232#issuecomment-1783814453","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2232","id":1783814453,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85qUtk1","user":{"login":"richardfontana","id":1179636,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk2MzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1179636?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana","html_url":"https://github.com/richardfontana","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-10-28T13:40:32Z","updated_at":"2023-12-20T13:57:02Z","body":"My initial assumption was that this variant could not be accommodated into `BSD-3-Clause` through markup revision but that might be wrong. \r\n\r\nLicense text:\r\n```\r\n * Redistribution and use in source and binary forms, with or without\r\n * modification, are permitted provided that the following conditions\r\n * are met:\r\n * 1. Redistributions of source code must retain the above copyright\r\n *    notice, this list of conditions, and the following disclaimer,\r\n *    without modification.\r\n * 2. Redistributions in binary form must reproduce at minimum a disclaimer\r\n *    substantially similar to the \"NO WARRANTY\" disclaimer below\r\n *    (\"Disclaimer\") and any redistribution must be conditioned upon\r\n *    including a substantially similar Disclaimer requirement for further\r\n *    binary redistribution.\r\n * 3. Neither the names of the above-listed copyright holders nor the names\r\n *    of any contributors may be used to endorse or promote products derived\r\n *    from this software without specific prior written permission.\r\n *\r\n * THIS SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED BY THE COPYRIGHT HOLDERS AND CONTRIBUTORS\r\n * \"AS IS\" AND ANY EXPRESS OR IMPLIED WARRANTIES, INCLUDING, BUT NOT\r\n * LIMITED TO, THE IMPLIED WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY AND FITNESS FOR\r\n * A PARTICULAR PURPOSE ARE DISCLAIMED. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE COPYRIGHT\r\n * OWNER OR CONTRIBUTORS BE LIABLE FOR ANY DIRECT, INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL,\r\n * SPECIAL, EXEMPLARY, OR CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES (INCLUDING, BUT NOT\r\n * LIMITED TO, PROCUREMENT OF SUBSTITUTE GOODS OR SERVICES; LOSS OF USE,\r\n * DATA, OR PROFITS; OR BUSINESS INTERRUPTION) HOWEVER CAUSED AND ON ANY\r\n * THEORY OF LIABILITY, WHETHER IN CONTRACT, STRICT LIABILITY, OR TORT\r\n * (INCLUDING NEGLIGENCE OR OTHERWISE) ARISING IN ANY WAY OUT OF THE USE\r\n * OF THIS SOFTWARE, EVEN IF ADVISED OF THE POSSIBILITY OF SUCH DAMAGE.\r\n ```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1783814453/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1803092955","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2232#issuecomment-1803092955","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2232","id":1803092955,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85reQPb","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-11-09T03:07:08Z","updated_at":"2023-11-09T03:07:08Z","body":"looks like the second clause re: binary distribution has a different obligation to \"at minimum a disclaimer substantially similar to the \"NO WARRANTY\" disclaimer below (\"Disclaimer\") and any redistribution must be conditioned upon including a substantially similar Disclaimer requirement for further binary redistribution\" instead of the usual reproduce the copyright notice and notice. \r\n\r\nI'd say that is substantively different. \r\n\r\n+1 to add in any case\r\n\r\nI think the id seems good, but I'd drop \"variant\"\r\n\r\n@richardfontana - can you add a link to the actual license?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1803092955/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1843735464","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2232#issuecomment-1843735464","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2232","id":1843735464,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85t5Suo","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-12-06T21:41:43Z","updated_at":"2023-12-06T21:41:43Z","body":"@richardfontana - is there (now) or should there be a corresponding Fedora issue, since it is in Fedora?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1843735464/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1843753883","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2232#issuecomment-1843753883","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2232","id":1843753883,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85t5XOb","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-12-06T21:56:42Z","updated_at":"2023-12-06T21:56:58Z","body":"Example of upstream license URL is at https://github.com/acpica/acpica/blob/master/source/common/acfileio.c, between lines 119-144.\r\n\r\nAgree that this differs from standard BSD-3-Clause despite being pretty close:\r\n* clause 1 includes \"without modification\" at the end\r\n* clause 2 has the different disclaimer notice requirement language\r\n\r\nThat said, it looks like this is similar to, but different from, similar formulations from other projects, e.g.:\r\n* from FreeBSD - https://github.com/freebsd/freebsd-src/blob/fc0288993cdad8a559fcd2c2166cf95f1fa43745/sys/dev/ath/ah_osdep.h#L13 -- 2-clause version\r\n* maybe from a fork of the Linux kernel - https://github.com/microsoft/CBL-Mariner-Linux-Kernel/blob/608c5f6879cb66f58dfb32cd1a0a619a3754415b/drivers/scsi/pm8001/pm8001_ctl.h#L13 -- includes the \"Alternatively, GPL\" language in the midst of the license text rather than the end\r\n* another 2-clause version: https://github.com/LionBSD/lionbsd/blob/249faff2027ac87550f4d870975985b88dcd7110/sbin/camcontrol/epc.c#L11\r\n\r\nInterestingly, I note that this acpica version references in clause 2, but does not include, the \"NO WARRANTY\" header just before the actual disclaimer text. The others linked above have that \"NO WARRANTY\" header.\r\n\r\nAll of this being said, I'm also +1 to add this, but I might suggest we call it `BSD-3-Clause-acpica` for ID and \"BSD 3-Clause acpica variant\" rather than tying it to Intel. And then separately the other variations linked above may warrant a separate look, but they probably aren't matches to this in any case  :)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1843753883/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1848429467","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2232#issuecomment-1848429467","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2232","id":1848429467,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85uLMub","user":{"login":"richardfontana","id":1179636,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk2MzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1179636?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana","html_url":"https://github.com/richardfontana","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/received_events","type"